sequenceDiagram
    participant Test as Test Runner<br/>(Go)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as Training Controller<br/>(KFTO / Trainer v2 / KubeRay)
    participant Kueue as Kueue<br/>(Admission Control)
    participant Worker as Worker Pods<br/>(Universal Training Image)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>(MinIO / AWS)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Test,HF: Flow 1: E2E Test Execution

    Test->>K8s: Create namespace<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Test->>K8s: Create Kueue resources<br/>(ClusterQueue, LocalQueue, ResourceFlavor)
    K8s->>Kueue: CRD watch triggers
    Test->>K8s: Create training CR<br/>(PyTorchJob / TrainJob / RayCluster)
    K8s->>Controller: CRD watch triggers
    Controller->>K8s: Create worker Pods
    K8s-->>Worker: Schedule on nodes

    Worker->>HF: Download model/dataset<br/>HF_TOKEN (optional)
    HF-->>Worker: Model artifacts

    Worker->>S3: Load training data<br/>AWS credentials
    S3-->>Worker: Training data

    Note over Worker: Training executes<br/>(multi-node, multi-GPU)

    Worker->>S3: Upload trained model<br/>AWS credentials

    Test->>K8s: Watch training CR status
    K8s-->>Test: Status: Succeeded

    Test->>Prom: Query GPU utilization<br/>TLS + CA verified
    Prom-->>Test: Metrics data

    Test->>K8s: Delete namespace<br/>(cleanup)

    Note over Test,HF: Flow 2: Universal Image Build (Konflux)

    participant Pipeline as Konflux Pipeline
    participant Cache as cachi2 Prefetch Cache
    participant Registry as Container Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Pipeline->>Cache: Prefetch Python deps<br/>(hermetic, --no-index)
    Cache-->>Pipeline: Cached artifacts

    Note over Pipeline: Builder stage:<br/>Install deps from cache<br/>(--find-links)

    Note over Pipeline: Final stage:<br/>Copy site-packages only<br/>(build tools excluded)

    Pipeline->>Registry: Push image<br/>TLS + Registry credentials
